msgctxt "124"
msgid "Don't think I'm gonna go easy on you, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "We'll see about that."
msgstr "Staremo a vedere."

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Don't think I'm gonna go easy on you, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Well, shall we go in?"
msgstr "Beh, entriamo?"

msgctxt "184"
msgid "...Hold on a second. I just realized I'm short on cash."
msgstr ""
"Ehm... Aspetta un attimo. Mi sono appena reso conto che sono a corto di "
"grana."

msgctxt "196"
msgid "What? Kiryu-san, what do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr "Scusa..."

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Oh, okay... Guess that's it, huh? I'm going home. Maybe we can try again "
"another time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "(I'd better bring enough cash next time...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Guess I lost... You're great at darts, too, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "I'm not that special."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"That was super fun. I hope you'll take me out again. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""
"Mi sono divertita un mondo. Spero che mi porterai fuori di nuovo. "
"<Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Later, Kiryu-san. Stop by the club soon, 'kay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Heh, guess I really gave you a run for your money, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "You weren't bad at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"The best matches are always close ones. Let me know if you ever wanna play "
"darts again. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Later, Kiryu-san. Stop by the club soon, 'kay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"I did it! I won! Did you see that, Kiryu-san? Hehehe... I totally walloped "
"you! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "You sure did."
msgstr "Direi proprio di sì."

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"I had tons of fun tonight. Invite me out again sometime. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Later, Kiryu-san. Stop by the club soon, 'kay?"
